colibri-core
------------------------------------------
Colibri Core is software to quickly and efficiently count and extract patterns
from large corpus data, to extract various statistics on the extracted
patterns, and to compute relations between the extracted patterns.

Runtime requirements:
  bash-5.2.21-1
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libbz2_1-1.0.8-2
  libcolibricore-devel-2.5.9-1bl2
  libcolibricore0-2.5.9-1bl2
  libgcc1-14.4.0-1
  libstdc++6-14.4.0-1
  pkg-config-3.0.10-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  autoconf-20260320-3
  automake-20261107-1
  binutils-2.47-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  gcc-g++-14.4.0-1
  libbz2-devel-1.0.8-2
  libtool-2.6.2-1
  make-4.4.1-2

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/proycon/colibri-core

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/proycon/colibri-core/archive/refs/tags/v2.5.9.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack colibri-core-2.5.9-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./colibri-core-2.5.9-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/colibri-core-2.5.9-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/colibri-core-2.5.9-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libcolibricore0-2.5.9-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libcolibricore-devel-2.5.9-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

